            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ agaburira abantu bose bo mur’ iryo shengero ryose ry’Abisirayeli, abagabo n’abagore, umwe‐umwe amuha umutsima n’inkekera y’inyama n’akarobe kabumbabumbge mu nzabibu zumye. Maz’ abantu bose barataha, umuntu wese asubira i we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
